      "content": "it's just that feeling... like everything's just noise and i'm just a speck. i look at the horizon and it feels like it doesn't matter if i'm here or not. if the wind just kept blowing the same way whether i was around or not, it just feels like there's no point to the struggle, you know? like there's no real weight to my existence.",
